{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ccd220e771ffcd814ca11a650926ad3f4bc4c48361c25fc6b4494fd70f9d2845",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10cc50e1b50877102257e583aea8be02819cf5c3dde9c5b34f8463468c726b9a",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n抱歉，能耽误你一点时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae99367a85e0627cbeb644801b384d2694fd7cb8e3a606054da5006f9af7cdf8",
      "text": "我现在无论如何\n都有些话想告诉你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8356ace1e6475a9ed272c4d751b6917ee6bb73544092f25a2d5581aaaf858b94",
      "text": "今天的拍摄结束后，负责写剧本的\n他的神情完全变了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bf705e11a51cee3d9ba5ca57dad3d241e2653e681a82962f283f326fc949936",
      "text": "和久别重逢时截然不同。\n就像学生时代那样，眼神中充满了希望。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998c4c115ddc98b27ee25741f2ca1fa3c29e3537103ddc2b96dcd139c0f4c1db",
      "text": "通过这次的拍摄，他的内心或许\n产生了某种转变吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0087de53e8ca763f7bae84b489120b41d71c45367e5a5f125121bb3b50b446b4",
      "text": "如果我们作为偶像，能够成为他的力量的话……\n那真是再令人高兴不过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:622e208fa5bc6ff860cc86d6e1aa2991f1e17ae6091ffd651a8b1fc7c1592123",
      "text": "我也很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28dc20e70a7654f48998a74192b7cf3947fbadd61bb15e8f0e8b6591e4cccecd",
      "text": "谢谢。这次能够和大家一起打造出\n如此出色的作品，真的太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:473c76e2a8083d9c45e64328a95fd234eedf47020c42370609d63a0b7836deed",
      "text": "你也帮了大忙。\n让我再次向你致谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_302_2_3_035_02_09_a:2_3_035_02_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d3afa8a7e03b9c456fa91981130a01f6c163da8cf7843bc0aebc9cd1024a675",
      "text": "那么，我先失陪了。\n明天起也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
